  "description": "Mark Nestor Property Services are delighted to present this one-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment available to rent in Boffin House Apartments, Termonbarry. Ideally located beside the River Shannon and marina, this property offers a peaceful and scenic setting while remaining close to local amenities.\n\nThe apartment comprises a comfortable open-plan living and kitchen area, a spacious double bedroom and a main bathroom. The property offers a bright and practical living space, making it an ideal home.\n\nTermonbarry is a popular riverside location with the River Shannon and marina right on your doorstep, while Longford town is approximately 5 minutes away by car, providing a wide range of shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and other amenities. The location also provides convenient access to surrounding towns and the wider area.\n\nA great opportunity to rent a comfortable apartment in a quiet location with the convenience of being just minutes from Longford town.\n\n***EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY***\n***REFERENCES ESSENTIAL***\n",
